  </section>

  <section id="first-hour" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Your first hour, step by step</h2>
    <DocCode language="bash" title="From clone to a running desktop">
{"git clone https://github.com/nikomatt69/cadcamfun.git\ncd cadcamfun\nbun install --frozen-lockfile\nbun run typecheck                 # all workspaces\nbun run test                      # bun test packages apps scripts\nbun run desktop:dev               # builds the sidecar + migrations, then tauri dev"}
    </DocCode>
    <ol>
      <li>When the window opens, the sidecar status turns ready within seconds; a new data directory is migrated on first launch.</li>
      <li>Create a project, add a drawing, draw a rectangle and extrude it.</li>
      <li>Open CAM, pick the solid and generate. Check the release level and claims before exporting NC.</li>
      <li>Open the history panel and commit: the project now has its first version.</li>
    </ol>
    <DocCallout type="info" title="No model key needed">
      <p>Everything above works without an AI provider. Add a key later in the assistant settings.</p>
    </DocCallout>
  </section>

